{"title":"Jackalhide Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 22) · Monster drop: Luna Moth, Werewolf</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 22 <span class=\"muted\">(998 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\">Jackal Pelt</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 2 of 287 looted corpses (1/144)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/144<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/3,778)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3,778<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"jackalhide-legs\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\">Jackal Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/32618f7713ad9256b405.svg\" alt=\"Jackalhide Legs\"></div><h3>Jackalhide Legs</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 22</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 10:17:01 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}